flowchart TD
    A[Manifest and immutable fingerprints] --> B[Baseline: Icarus + VVP + Verilator + Yosys]
    B --> C[Evidence and bounded source context]
    C --> D[Structured hypothesis]
    D --> E[Minimal unified diff]
    E --> F{Patch policy and exact context}
    F -->|reject| C
    F -->|allow| G[Fresh isolated copy of baseline]
    G --> H[Compile / target simulation / lint / synthesis]
    H -->|fail within budget| C
    H -->|pass| I[Independent regression seeds]
    I -->|fail within budget| C
    I -->|pass and immutable hashes equal| J[Accept patch + Evidence Report]
    C -->|repeat, budget, provider or infrastructure error| K[Safe failure with trace]
